  url = {https://arxiv.org/pdf/1301.4429},
  note = {Opened author preprint version2, dated17August2015. Section3.2 and Proposition3.5, authorp6, identify the actual cuspidally central quotient with the torus-torsor fundamental group. Theorem5.10 and its complete proof, authorpp12--13, give a section lift over Q for unions of torsion sub-packets. The root audit retains the section input and quotient target and computes its precise class-two geometric pro-prime specialization for a once-punctured elliptic curve. No full punctured-normalizer lift is inferred.}
